  "description": "Compare INDIBA Deep Care, Cutera excel HR and FineXel fractional CO2 at {{brand}} in Cairo. See how each device is used and what to ask before treatment.",
  "h1": "Aesthetic devices at {{brand}}.",
  "updated": "2026-11-24",
  "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> · <span>Devices</span></nav>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Our treatment devices</p>\n        <h1 class=\"page-hero__title\">Aesthetic devices<br><em>at {{brand}}.</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"page-hero__lede\">Explore INDIBA Deep Care, Cutera excel HR and FineXel fractional CO2 laser at {{brand}} in Cairo. Open each device page for treatment details, videos and booking.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section device-catalogue\" aria-label=\"Explore our devices\">\n      <div class=\"container\"><div class=\"device-grid\">\n      <a class=\"device-card\" href=\"/devices/indiba-deep-care\" aria-labelledby=\"catalogue-indiba-title\">\n        <div class=\"device-card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/images/indiba-deep-care.webp\" alt=\"INDIBA Deep Care\" width=\"1801\" height=\"1683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n        <div class=\"device-card__body\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Radiofrequency care</p>\n          <h2 id=\"catalogue-indiba-title\">INDIBA Deep Care</h2>\n          <p class=\"device-card__summary\">448 kHz radiofrequency for face and body care. Explore the technology, treatment considerations and a clinic session.</p>\n          <span class=\"device-card__link\"><span>Learn more</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"device-card\" href=\"/devices/cutera-excel-hr\" aria-labelledby=\"catalogue-cutera-title\">\n        <div class=\"device-card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/videos/posters/cutera-excel-hr.jpg\" alt=\"Cutera excel HR\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n        <div class=\"device-card__body\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Laser hair removal</p>\n          <h2 id=\"catalogue-cutera-title\">Cutera excel HR</h2>\n          <p class=\"device-card__summary\">Laser care with 755 nm and 1064 nm wavelength options. Learn about hair reduction and see the device at the clinic.</p>\n          <span class=\"device-card__link\"><span>Learn more</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"device-card\" href=\"/devices/finexel-fractional-co2\" aria-labelledby=\"catalogue-finexel-title\">\n        <div class=\"device-card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/videos/posters/finexel-fractional-co2.jpg\" alt=\"FineXel CO2\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n        <div class=\"device-card__body\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Fractional CO2 laser</p>\n          <h2 id=\"catalogue-finexel-title\">FineXel CO2</h2>\n          <p class=\"device-card__summary\">Fractional CO2 skin resurfacing. Read about texture, acne scars and recovery, and watch the clinic video.</p>\n          <span class=\"device-card__link\"><span>Learn more</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </div></div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section cta-band\">\n      <div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"cta-band__title\">Find the care you need.</h2><p class=\"cta-band__sub\">Tell us what you would like to improve. Our team will help you understand the options and confirm which branch offers the treatment.</p><div class=\"cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"/book\" data-open-booking>Book appointment</a></div></div>\n    </section>\n  ",
